rter retired in #453, whose media_count counted a list truncated\n    to 50 examples (#449). [source=ingredient_occurrences.tsv culturemech_rev=15a4da5c08\n    rows=194137 distinct_recipes=15257]'\n- timestamp: '2026-08-30T04:48:06.233536+00:00'\n  curator: claude_culturemech_alias_backfill\n  action: ADDED_SYNONYMS\n  changes: 'Added 5 CultureMech recipe surface form(s) that folded onto this record''s\n    published label but were absent from MIM''s label index, so CultureMech could\n    not resolve them: ''Horse Serum (Gibco)*'' (x1 CultureMech mentions); ''Horse\n    Serum (RM1239)'' (x1 CultureMech mentions); ''Horse Serum (not inactivated)''\n    (x1 CultureMech mentions); ''Horse serum (Invitrogen)'' (x1 CultureMech mentions);\n    ''Horse serum (Oxoid)'' (x1 CultureMech mentions). Source: culturemech:output/ingredient_occurrences.tsv.'\n  llm_assisted: false\nnotes: Imported from mim-queue (source_id=mediadive.ingredient:146); no CAS-RN or\n  CHEBI/NCIT match. Curator review needed.\nontology_mapping:\n  ontology_id: MICRO:0001235\n  ontology_label: horse serum\n  ontology_source: MICRO\n  mapping_quality: EXACT_MATCH\n  evidence:\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: MICRO via OLS search (resolve_unmapped)\n    notes: Auto-upgraded from UNMAPPED_0403; matched via 'Horse serum' (name normalization);\n      label-exact\ningredient_type: UNDEFINED_MIXTURE\n"
