    "raw_text": "identifier: CHEBI:234035\npreferred_term: Carboxymethyl cellulose\nontology_mapping:\n  ontology_id: CHEBI:234035\n  ontology_label: carboxymethylcellulose sodium salt\n  ontology_source: CHEBI\n  mapping_quality: SYNONYM_MATCH\n  evidence:\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: CultureMech\n    notes: Imported from CultureMech pipeline, quality=DIRECT_MATCH\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: MIM curation (#320)\n    notes: 'identifier/ontology_id CHEBI:85146 (''carboxymethylcellulose'') -> CHEBI:234035\n      (''carboxymethylcellulose sodium salt''). The record''s own cas_rn 9004-32-4\n      is registered by ChEBI against CHEBI:234035, which is the sodium salt of the\n      term the record previously carried. Curation decision on #320: where the CAS\n      names a more specific FORM than the label, the CAS governs \u2014 the recipe is taken\n      to mean the substance actually weighed out. These surfaced as ''unrelated''\n      in the ancestry triage only because ChEBI does not model salt-of / hydrate-of\n      / racemate-of as subsumption, the same gap #342 recorded for hydrates.'\nsynonyms:\n- synonym_text: ( sodium salt)\n  synonym_type: RAW_TEXT\n  source: CultureMech\n- synonym_text: CMC\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: Carboximethylcellulosum\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: Carboxymethylcellulose\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: Carboxymethylcellulosum\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: Celluloseglycolic acid\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: Glycolic acid cellulose ether\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: carmellosum\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: carmelosa\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: croscarmellose\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: croscarmellosum\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: croscarmelosa\n  synonym_type: EXACT_SYNONYM\n  source: kg_microbe\n- synonym_text: (sodium salt)\n  synonym_type: RAW_TEXT\n  source: CultureMech\n- synonym_text: Carboxymethyl cellulose (sodium salt)\n  synonym_type: RAW_TEXT\n  source: MERGED_FROM (#394)\n- synonym_text: Carboxymethylcellulose sodium\n  synonym_type: RAW_TEXT\n  source: MERGED_FROM (#394)\n- synonym_text: CMC-Na\n  synonym_type: RAW_TEXT\n  source: MERGED_FROM (#394)\n- synonym_text: Carboxymethyl cellulose, sodium salt\n  synonym_type: RAW_TEXT\n  source: culturemech:output/ingredient_occurrences.tsv\n- synonym_text: Carmellose\n  synonym_type: RAW_TEXT\n  source: sssom_other_backfill\nmapping_status: MAPPED\noccurrence_statistics:\n  total_occurrences: 7\n  media_count: 7\ncuration_history:\n- timestamp: '2026-03-09T06:54:18.022301+00:00'\n  curator: import_from_culturemech\n  action: IMPORTED\n  changes: Initial import from CultureMech pipeline\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-04-05T21:48:44.822001+00:00'\n  curator: fetch_cas_rn_from_culturebot_csv\n  action: ADDED_CAS_RN\n  changes: 'Added CAS-RN:9004-32-4 from CultureBotHT compounds_to_cas.csv (matched:\n    Carboxymethylcellulose)'\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-04-09T00:32:50.689620+00:00'\n  curator: enrich_mim_cas_rn_batch\n  action: CAS_RN_ADDED\n  changes: Added CAS-RN 9004-32-4 from CultureBotHT/compounds_to_cas.csv\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-04-18T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: cbclaw_kg_microbe_sweep\n  action: ADDED_SYNONYMS\n  changes: 'Added 11 synonyms from kg-microbe P4.4 enrichment: CMC, Carboximethylcellulosum,\n    Carboxymethylcellulose, Carboxymethylcellulosum, Celluloseglycolic acid, ... (6\n    more)'\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: true\n- timestamp: '2026-04-18T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: cbclaw_kg_microbe_sweep\n  action: ADDED_SYNONYMS\n  changes: 'Added 11 synonyms from kg-microbe P4.4 enrichment: CMC, Carboximethylcellulosum,\n    Carboxymethyl cellulose, Carboxymethylcellulosum, Celluloseglycolic acid, ...\n    (6 more)'\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: true\n- timestamp: '2026-04-19T07:39:23.955331+00:00'\n  curator: audit_mim_merge\n  action: MERGED_FROM_DUPLICATES\n  changes: 'Absorbed 1 duplicate MIM record(s) into this one: Carboxymethylcellulose.yaml.\n    Synonyms, curation_history, and occurrence counts were unioned/summed; winner\n    selected by highest occurrence count with preferred_term readability tie-break.'\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-01T07:35:32.612448+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_CLASSIFY_INGREDIENT_TYPE\n  changes: set ingredient_type=SINGLE_INGREDIENT (CHEBI primary)\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-02T03:12:13.108701+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_CLASSIFY_INGREDIENT_TYPE\n  changes: set ingredient_type=SINGLE_INGREDIENT (CHEBI primary)\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-06-03T02:06:01.736720+00:00'\n  curator: infer_roles_from_name_lists\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Added media role: CARBON_SOURCE (confidence: 0.80)'\n- timestamp: '2026-06-09T05:23:46.735527+00:00'\n  curator: correct_stale_ontology_labels.py\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: 'ontology_label ''Carboxymethyl cellulose'' -> ''carboxymethylcellulose'':\n    synced to canonical CHEBI label (preferred_term ''Carboxymethyl cellulose'' unchanged).'\n- timestamp: '2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: migrate_media_roles_to_facets\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Migrated legacy media_roles to role facets (#128): CARBON_SOURCE -> nutritional_roles.CARBON_SOURCE'\n- timestamp: '2026-08-13T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: reground_cas_specific_form\n  action: REGROUNDED_TO_CAS_SPECIFIC_FORM\n  changes: identifier/ontology_id CHEBI:85146 -> CHEBI:234035 'carboxymethylcellulose\n    sodium salt' (#320); the record's CAS 9004-32-4 denotes the sodium salt. mapping_quality\n    -> SYNONYM_MATCH.\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-08-18T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: merge_cmc_records\n  action: MERGED_FROM\n  changes: 'Absorbed ''Carboxymethyl cellulose (sodium salt)'' (#394). The two were\n    crossed: the generic-looking record held the SALT''s term (CHEBI:234035) while\n    the salt-labelled record held FOODON:03460374. Codex read the four source strings\n    behind this record''s occurrences and they are genuinely mixed \u2014 2 plain (''Carboxymethyl\n    cellulose'', KOMODO 1111 and DSMZ 1111) and 2 explicitly sodium salt (''Carboxymethyl\n    cellulose, sodium salt'', JCM 1052; ''Carboxymethylcellulose (CMC), sodium salt'',\n    DSMZ 1684) \u2014 and DSMZ 1111''s own prep note specifies the sodium salt. CultureBotHT''s\n    compounds_to_cas.csv maps BOTH the plain and the sodium name to the same CAS 9004-32-4,\n    so the upstream conflation is already there. Resolved under the orderability rule:\n    an ingredient maps to a specific chemical someone can order, picking one by convention\n    when sources disagree. CHEBI:234035 carries cas:9004-32-4 \u2014 the product a lab\n    buys \u2014 while the plain term CHEBI:85146 carries cas:9000-11-7, a different purchase.\n    Both labels remain resolvable as synonyms.'\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-08-18T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: add_supplied_form\n  action: ADDED_SUPPLIED_FORM\n  changes: Recorded the purchasable form separately from identity. The record's identity\n    question (#394) was settled by CAS, but that put procurement detail into the mapping.\n    supplied_form carries it instead, so the identifier is free to optimise for how\n    the node reads in the KG.\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-08-27T03:16:39.518508+00:00'\n  curator: refresh_occurrence_statistics\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: 'occurrence_statistics 4/4 -> 7/7 (media_count/total_occurrences), derived\n    from distinct CultureMech recipe ids in the #337 occurrence table. The prior values\n    came from the importer retired in #453, whose media_count counted a list truncated\n    to 50 examples (#449). [source=ingredient_occurrences.tsv culturemech_rev=15a4da5c08\n    rows=194137 distinct_recipes=15257]'\n- timestamp: '2026-08-30T04:48:06.233536+00:00'\n  curator: claude_culturemech_alias_backfill\n  action: ADDED_SYNONYMS\n  changes: 'Added 1 CultureMech recipe surface form(s) that folded onto this record''s\n    published label but were absent from MIM''s label index, so CultureMech could\n    not resolve them: ''Carboxymethyl cellulose, sodium salt'' (x1 CultureMech mentions).\n    Source: culturemech:output/ingredient_occurrences.tsv.'\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-09-02T17:40:44.716277+00:00'\n  curator: claude_sssom_surface_form_backfill\n  action: ADDED_SYNONYMS\n  changes: 'Recovered 1 surface form(s) that the published SSSOM `other` carried but\n    no curated record did, so a rebuild would have dropped them from KGX: ''Carmellose''.\n    Tokens already present on the kg-microbe ontology node were left out as redundant\n    (#520).'\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-09-09T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: fix_kg_microbe_node_id_drift\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: kg_microbe_node_id CHEBI:85146 -> CHEBI:234035 (#554). The compatibility\n    node id lagged a same-prefix identifier correction; the downstream node id must\n    match the curated identifier unless a record intentionally crosses CURIE prefixes.\n  llm_assisted: false\nkg_microbe_node_id: CHEBI:234035\nchemical_properties:\n  cas_rn: 9004-32-4\n  data_source: CultureBotHT/compounds_to_cas.csv\n  retrieval_date: '2026-04-09T00:32:50.689620+00:00'\ningredient_type: SINGLE_INGREDIENT\nnutritional_roles:\n- role: CARBON_SOURCE\n  confidence: 0.8\n  evidence:\n  - reference_type: COMPUTATIONAL_PREDICTION\n    reference_text: Inferred from curated media-role name pattern\n    curator_note: Provisional role from a curated name-pattern rule; review recommended.\nsupplied_form:\n- name: Carboxymethylcellulose sodium\n  cas_rn: 9004-32-4\n  form: sodium salt\n  supplier: Sigma-Aldrich\n  catalog_number: C-5013\n  notes: 'The form DSMZ 1111''s preparation note specifies (''Carboxymethyl cellulose,\n    sodium salt, high viscosity (Sigma No. C-5013), works well'') even though its\n    ingredient string says plain. JCM 1052 and DSMZ 1684 name the sodium salt in the\n    ingredient string itself. #394.'\n"
  },
