iants, so kgmicrobe.compound:abyssomicin_b was retained\n    without ontology promotion.\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: true\n- timestamp: '2026-06-02T07:05:13.385842+00:00'\n  curator: infer_roles_from_name_lists\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Added media role: SELECTIVE_AGENT (confidence: 0.80)'\n- timestamp: '2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: migrate_media_roles_to_facets\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Migrated legacy media_roles to role facets (#128): SELECTIVE_AGENT ->\n    physicochemical_roles.SELECTIVE_AGENT'\ningredient_type: SINGLE_INGREDIENT\nnotes: '2026-05-10 manual candidate review: retained kgmicrobe.compound primary identifier;\n  reviewed OLS candidates were not exact identity matches for the source label.'\nphysicochemical_roles:\n- role: SELECTIVE_AGENT\n  confidence: 0.8\n  evidence:\n  - reference_type: COMPUTATIONAL_PREDICTION\n    reference_text: Inferred from curated media-role name pattern\n    curator_note: Provisional role from a curated name-pattern rule; review recommended.\n"
