 '2026-04-19T07:39:23.955331+00:00'\n  curator: audit_mim_merge\n  action: MERGED_FROM_DUPLICATES\n  changes: 'Absorbed 7 duplicate MIM record(s) into this one: Sodium_Acetate.yaml,\n    Na_Acetate.yaml, Sodium_Acetate_2.yaml, Sodium_Acetate_3.yaml, 1_M_Sodium_Acetate.yaml,\n    Na-acetate_2.yaml, Na_Acetate_2.yaml. Synonyms, curation_history, and occurrence\n    counts were unioned/summed; winner selected by highest occurrence count with preferred_term\n    readability tie-break.'\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-01T07:35:34.974015+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_CLASSIFY_INGREDIENT_TYPE\n  changes: set ingredient_type=SINGLE_INGREDIENT (CHEBI primary)\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-01T08:08:31.031261+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_BACKFILL_CHEBI_CHEMISTRY\n  changes: molecular_formula=C2H3O2.Na; inchi=InChI=1S/C2H4O2.Na/c1-2(3)4;/h1H3,(H,3,4);/q;+1/p-;\n    smiles=CC(=O)[O-].[Na+]\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-01T08:09:47.967535+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: APPLY_EVIDENCE_PROPOSAL\n  changes: added pmid=38190851 from propose-evidence batch\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-02T03:12:16.751191+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_CLASSIFY_INGREDIENT_TYPE\n  changes: set ingredient_type=SINGLE_INGREDIENT (chemical structure populated (molecular_formula))\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-29T23:35:36.112025+00:00'\n  curator: extract_roles_from_synonyms\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Added media role: BUFFER (confidence: 1.00)'\n- timestamp: '2026-06-09T05:23:46.803304+00:00'\n  curator: correct_stale_ontology_labels.py\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: 'ontology_label ''Na-acetate'' -> ''sodium acetate'': synced to canonical\n    CHEBI label (preferred_term ''Na-acetate'' unchanged).'\n- timestamp: '2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: migrate_media_roles_to_facets\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Migrated legacy media_roles to role facets (#128): BUFFER -> physicochemical_roles.BUFFER'\n- timestamp: '2026-08-20T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: merge_identifier_collisions\n  action: MERGED_FROM\n  changes: 'Absorbed ''Sodium acetate'' (#414). Both records held CHEBI:32954 while\n    both were live, which MIM''s own rule forbids \u2014 for a mapped record the identifier\n    IS the ontology CURIE, so two live records on it assert that two ingredients are\n    one thing. They are one thing: abbreviation versus full name for one salt; identical\n    CAS 127-09-3 and formula C2H3O2.Na. ''Na-acetate'' wins as the label media actually\n    use (806 occurrences against 3); the other survives as a RAW_TEXT synonym, so\n    label_index still answers for it.'\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-08-27T03:16:39.519386+00:00'\n  curator: refresh_occurrence_statistics\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: 'occurrence_statistics 140/809 -> 1165/1166 (media_count/total_occurrences),\n    derived from distinct CultureMech recipe ids in the #337 occurrence table. The\n    prior values came from the importer retired in #453, whose media_count counted\n    a list truncated to 50 examples (#449). [source=ingredient_occurrences.tsv culturemech_rev=15a4da5c08\n    rows=194137 distinct_recipes=15257]'\n- timestamp: '2026-09-23T06:21:57.601684+00:00'\n  curator: claude\n  action: REJECTED_WRONG_FORM_SYNONYMS\n  changes: 'Retyped REJECTED_LABEL: ''Optional ingredient'' (RAW_TEXT): a CultureMech\n    recipe annotation, not a name of sodium acetate (#232). The token is kept as provenance\n    only; it must not resolve, be exported, or enter the SSSOM other column.'\n  previous_status: MAPPED\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: true\n  llm_model: claude-fable-5-1\nchemical_properties:\n  cas_rn: 127-09-3\n  data_source: PubChem API (preprocessed)\n  retrieval_date: '2026-04-05T23:45:31.463714+00:00'\n  molecular_formula: C2H3O2.Na\n  inchi