ing_review_2026_05_05\n  action: MERGED\n  changes: Absorbed duplicate record Na2edta2h2o.yaml (UNMAPPED_0040) into Na2edta2h2o.yaml;\n    source occurrence counts and synonyms were merged. Exact local EDTA disodium salt\n    dihydrate mapping CHEBI:64758.\n  previous_status: MAPPED\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-06-14T06:54:43.190263+00:00'\n  curator: infer_roles_from_chebi_ancestry\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Added media role: CHELATOR (confidence: 0.70)'\n- timestamp: '2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: migrate_media_roles_to_facets\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Migrated legacy media_roles to role facets (#128): CHELATOR -> physicochemical_roles.CHELATOR'\n- timestamp: '2026-08-06T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: issue_114_cas_audit\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: 'cas_rn 205-358-3 -> 6381-92-6. 205-358-3 is an EC/EINECS registry number\n    (format NNN-NNN-N), not a CAS-RN \u2014 the same class of fetch_cas_rn_from_pubchem\n    mis-assignment as Beef extract''s 103-47-9 (=CHES) in #114. The replacement is\n    this record''s own CHEBI term CHEBI:64758''s CAS dbxref, and that term''s label\n    matches the substance, so it is evidence rather than inference. The EC number\n    is recorded here rather than discarded: it was correct information in the wrong\n    field.'\n  llm_assisted: true\n- timestamp: '2026-08-10T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: regrade_synonym_matches\n  action: REGRADED_EXACT_TO_SYNONYM\n  changes: mapping_quality EXACT_MATCH -> SYNONYM_MATCH (#317). The record's label\n    does not equal the term's primary label 'EDTA disodium salt dihydrate'; it matches\n    the ChEBI synonym 'Na2H2EDTA.2H2O' on CHEBI:64758. The schema defines EXACT_MATCH\n    as a direct match to the term and SYNONYM_MATCH as a match to a known synonym,\n    so the recorded grade overstated. ontology_id is unchanged \u2014 the term is correct.\n    The SSSOM predicate is unaffected (both grades emit skos:exactMatch).\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-08-13T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: merge_minted_hydrate_duplicates\n  action: MERGED_FROM\n  changes: Absorbed 'Na2-EDTA x 2 H2O' (#321), which differs from this record only\n    in notation the merge pass does not recognise as the same substance, so it escaped\n    dedup and was grounded to the anhydrous parent. It had just been minted 'kgmicrobe.compound:na2-edta_x_2_h2o'\n    on the false premise that ChEBI has no term for this hydrate \u2014 ChEBI label search\n    for the dihydrate of the minted-off parent. Occurrences 10/10 + 103/64 -> 113/74.\n    Raw label kept as a RAW_TEXT synonym.\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-08-27T03:16:39.519455+00:00'\n  curator: refresh_occurrence_statistics\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: 'occurrence_statistics 74/113 -> 139/140 (media_count/total_occurrences),\n    derived from distinct CultureMech recipe ids in the #337 occurrence table. The\n    prior values came from the importer retired in #453, whose media_count counted\n    a list truncated to 50 examples (#449). [source=ingredient_occurrences.tsv culturemech_rev=15a4da5c08\n    rows=194137 distinct_recipes=15257]'\nchemical_properties:\n  cas_rn: 6381-92-6\n  data_source: 'CHEBI dbxref on CHEBI:64758 (corrected from an EC number, #114)'\n  retrieval_date: '2026-04-05T23:45:49.334710+00:00'\n  molecular_formula: C10H14N2O8.2H2O.2Na\n  inchi: InChI=1S/C10H16N2O8.2Na.2H2O/c13-7(14)3-11(4-8(15)16)1-2-12(5-9(17)18)6-10(19)20;;;;/h1-6H2,(H,13,14)(H,15,16)(H,17,18)(H,19,20);;;2*1H2/q;2*+1;;/p-2\n  smiles: O.O.O=C([O-])C[NH+](CC[NH+](CC(=O)[O-])CC(=O)[O-])CC(=O)[O-].[Na+].[Na+]\ningredient_type: SINGLE_INGREDIENT\nphysicochemical_roles:\n- role: CHELATOR\n  confidence: 0.7\n  evidence:\n  - reference_type: COMPUTATIONAL_PREDICTION\n    reference_text: 'Inferred from CHEBI ancestry: subclass/has_role of CHEBI:38161\n      (chelator (role))'\n    curator_note: Provisional role inferred from CHEBI is_a/has_role closure; review\n      recommended.\