    "raw_text": "identifier: cas:1040352-40-6\npreferred_term: 2-Keto-D-gluconic acid hemicalcium salt hydrate\nontology_mapping:\n  ontology_id: CHEBI:27469\n  ontology_label: 2-dehydro-D-gluconic acid\n  ontology_source: CHEBI\n  mapping_quality: NARROW_MATCH\n  evidence:\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: CultureBotHT\n    notes: Imported from CultureBotHT. CAS-RN 1040352-40-6 present, but no CHEBI entry\n      exists (checked OAK CHEBI sqlite + PubChem CID synonyms). Curator can promote\n      to a CHEBI primary if/when CHEBI adds the term.\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: anchor_cas_hydrate_records\n    notes: 2-Keto-D-gluconic acid hemicalcium salt hydrate is a hydrate/salt with\n      its own CAS and no exact ChEBI term; anchored to the parent CHEBI:27469 '2-dehydro-D-gluconic\n      acid' by narrowMatch per MAPPING_SEMANTICS.md Section 3 step 2. hemicalcium\n      salt hydrate of 2-dehydro-D-gluconic acid\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: MIM curation (#342)\n    notes: 'mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch\n      -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning*\n      than CHEBI:27469 (''2-dehydro-D-gluconic acid'') \u2014 a subsumption ChEBI itself\n      denies: it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 ''hydrate'', never under the anhydrous\n      compound, which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct\n      substance containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch\n      claims similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record''s own\n      identifier are unchanged.'\n  - evidence_type: MANUAL_CURATION\n    source: MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)\n    notes: 'CAS1040352-40-6 and K6250 source name agree on hemicalcium salt hydrate\n      with unspecified xH2O. Keep distinct from the separately curated monohydrate/MPBio\n      owner. Keep CHEBI27469 acid as the verified available parent for salt/hydrate\n      grounding; do not select CHEBI3309 calcium gluconate, which lacks the keto group.\n      Own CAS remains exact; B1 local identity is generated separately. Only CAS and\n      source provenance are active. PubChem''s fixed-water representation is not enough\n      to backfill a stoichiometric formula/structure against supplier xH2O. Primary\n      source references: https://www.sigmaaldrich.com/US/en/product/sigma/k6250; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/substance/sourceid/Sigma-Aldrich/K6250_SIGMA/JSON;\n      https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/1040352-40-6/property/Title,MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,CanonicalSMILES/JSON;\n      https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/27469/. Captures, exact\n      input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json.\n      This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed\n      owner bytes withdraw inherited support.'\nsynonyms: []\nmapping_status: MAPPED\noccurrence_statistics:\n  total_occurrences: 0\n  media_count: 0\ncuration_history:\n- timestamp: '2026-04-29T06:51:33.117170+00:00'\n  curator: audit_add_remaining_culturebotht\n  action: CREATED_FROM_CAS_FALLBACK\n  changes: Created with cas:1040352-40-6 as primary identifier; no CHEBI entry exists\n    for this compound.\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-01T07:35:31.736263+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_CLASSIFY_INGREDIENT_TYPE\n  changes: 'set ingredient_type=SINGLE_INGREDIENT (cas: primary (defined chemical))'\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-02T03:12:11.858997+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_CLASSIFY_INGREDIENT_TYPE\n  changes: 'set ingredient_type=SINGLE_INGREDIENT (cas: primary (defined chemical))'\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-06-03T03:22:14.577913+00:00'\n  curator: infer_roles_from_name_lists\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Added media role: CARBON_SOURCE (confidence: 0.80)'\n- timestamp: '2026-06-04T05:38:59.199997+00:00'\n  curator: infer_energy_source\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Added media role: ENERGY_SOURCE (confidence: 0.70)'\n- timestamp: '2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: migrate_media_roles_to_facets\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Migrated legacy media_roles to role facets (#128): CARBON_SOURCE -> nutritional_roles.CARBON_SOURCE;\n    ENERGY_SOURCE -> nutritional_roles.ENERGY_SOURCE'\n- timestamp: '2026-08-05T18:02:35.008352+00:00'\n  curator: anchor_cas_hydrate_records\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: 'Added Section 3 anchor rows: narrowMatch CHEBI:27469 ''2-dehydro-D-gluconic\n    acid'' and registry kgmicrobe.compound:2-keto-d-gluconic_acid_hemicalcium_salt_hydrate.\n    identifier cas:1040352-40-6 unchanged; mapping_quality FALLBACK_REGISTRY -> NARROW_MATCH.\n    hemicalcium salt hydrate of 2-dehydro-D-gluconic acid'\n  llm_assisted: true\n- timestamp: '2026-08-13T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: regrade_hydrate_to_close_match\n  action: REGRADED_HYDRATE_TO_CLOSE_MATCH\n  changes: mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH (#342); a hydrate is not subsumed\n    by its anhydrous form, and ChEBI does not model it as such.\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-11-03T06:07:03.766598+00:00'\n  curator: claude\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: 'Step 7d (#901; #1117 where applicable): applied only the reviewed field\n    changes [{\"op\":\"set\",\"path\":[\"ontology_mapping\",\"mapping_quality\"],\"before\":\"CLOSE_MATCH\",\"after\":\"NARROW_MATCH\"}].\n    Original values are preserved here and in the immutable source preimages. Appended\n    scoped mapping evidence. NARROW_MATCH serializes skos:broadMatch; CAS_RN_LOOKUP\n    on the form-specific NCIt identity serializes skos:exactMatch. Preserved prior\n    history, roles, status and occurrence counts; no owner merge or new scientific\n    approval. Review: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-a/; primary\n    captures: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json.'\n  previous_status: MAPPED\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: true\n  llm_model: gpt-6\nchemical_properties:\n  cas_rn: 1040352-40-6\n  data_source: CultureBotHT compounds_to_cas.csv\n  retrieval_date: '2026-04-29T06:51:33.117170+00:00'\ningredient_type: SINGLE_INGREDIENT\nnutritional_roles:\n- role: CARBON_SOURCE\n  confidence: 0.8\n  evidence:\n  - reference_type: COMPUTATIONAL_PREDICTION\n    reference_text: Inferred from curated media-role name pattern\n    curator_note: Provisional role from a curated name-pattern rule; review recommended.\n- role: ENERGY_SOURCE\n  confidence: 0.7\n  evidence:\n  - reference_type: COMPUTATIONAL_PREDICTION\n    reference_text: Canonical energy substrate (catabolised for energy)\n    curator_note: Provisional ENERGY_SOURCE added alongside CARBON_SOURCE; review\n      recommended.\n"
  },
