    "raw_text": "identifier: CHEBI:11449\npreferred_term: 2,5-didehydro-D-gluconate\nontology_mapping:\n  ontology_id: CHEBI:11449\n  ontology_label: 2,5-didehydro-D-gluconate\n  ontology_source: CHEBI\n  mapping_quality: EXACT_MATCH\n  evidence:\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: microbedecoder original CSV; BacDive; ChEBI\n    notes: 'Exact original 2,5-didehydro-D-gluconate labels occur twice, both in BacDive_Metabolite_production:\n      CSV line 2121 / BacDive 34 and line 8749 / BacDive 58. Each source cell separately\n      contains the mono-keto label. CHEBI:11449 denotes this di-keto anion, distinct\n      from CHEBI:58143. The archived BacDive production results for CHEBI:11449 in\n      strains 34 and 58 are explicitly No (ph-x/text-danger icons, alt=No and title=No).\n      Empty text extraction had omitted those result attributes. The count of two\n      remains source-field label appearances; neither positive production nor a chemical\n      role is inferred. Recovered legacy damaged label 5-didehydro-D-gluconate is\n      retained as RAW_TEXT on this source-established identity under the damaged-label\n      exception; it must not resolve to the mono-keto owner. Clarification: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/313#issuecomment-6588401935\n      . No CAS, recipe occurrence or inherited mono-keto chemistry is added. Sources:\n      https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/CHEBI:11449 ; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/CHEBI:58143\n      ; https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/34 ; https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/58 . https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/313#issuecomment-6588292718.\n      Hash-bound source captures: reports/step7c_source_labels_313_235_20261102/source-evidence.json\n      (sha256 1a7185b74de90578fe5f42d3d44cf7c798dccb5e5fd56fc3c1c01885499b85d0). Source-field\n      counts are not recipe occurrences or positive experimental outcomes. Preserved\n      superseded source assertions and history. No scientific/release approval is\n      asserted. Inspected the archived Metabolite production tables at https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/34\n      and https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/58. Headers bind the exact CHEBI:11449/name\n      row to the Production column; both cells explicitly encode No in icon alt/title\n      attributes and ph-x classes. Neighboring mono-keto controls encode Yes (ph-check);\n      their original ChEBI links are retained verbatim without assigning that source\n      link as a new MIM identity. Exact headers, row HTML, icon attributes and immutable\n      input hashes: reports/diketo_bacdive_evidence_1111_20261102/source-evidence.json\n      sha256=41defe43ca5fc06502964d155ea58376d5420c0ce2cb8ffe660294c18638d892. Finding\n      https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1111; decision https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1111#issuecomment-6588588040.'\nmapping_status: MAPPED\nsynonyms:\n- synonym_text: 5-didehydro-D-gluconate\n  synonym_type: RAW_TEXT\n  source: microbedecoder\noccurrence_statistics:\n  total_occurrences: 0\n  media_count: 0\n  source_occurrences:\n  - source: microbedecoder\n    count: 2\n    source_columns: BacDive_Metabolite_production\ningredient_type: SINGLE_INGREDIENT\ncuration_history:\n- timestamp: '2026-11-02T21:05:51.410555+00:00'\n  curator: Codex\n  action: CREATED_FROM_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_LABEL\n  changes: 'Exact original 2,5-didehydro-D-gluconate labels occur twice, both in BacDive_Metabolite_production:\n    CSV line 2121 / BacDive 34 and line 8749 / BacDive 58. Each source cell separately\n    contains the mono-keto label. CHEBI:11449 denotes this di-keto anion, distinct\n    from CHEBI:58143. The live BacDive production values are blank: no positive production\n    assertion or chemical role is inferred. Recovered legacy damaged label 5-didehydro-D-gluconate\n    is retained as RAW_TEXT on this source-established identity under the damaged-label\n    exception; it must not resolve to the mono-keto owner. Clarification: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/313#issuecomment-6588401935\n    . No CAS, recipe occurrence or inherited mono-keto chemistry is added. Sources:\n    https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/CHEBI:11449 ; https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/CHEBI:58143\n    ; https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/34 ; https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/58 . https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/313#issuecomment-6588292718.\n    Hash-bound source captures: reports/step7c_source_labels_313_235_20261102/source-evidence.json\n    (sha256 1a7185b74de90578fe5f42d3d44cf7c798dccb5e5fd56fc3c1c01885499b85d0). Source-field\n    counts are not recipe occurrences or positive experimental outcomes. Preserved\n    superseded source assertions and history. No scientific/release approval is asserted.'\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: true\n  llm_model: gpt-6\n- timestamp: '2026-11-02T21:16:28.036054+00:00'\n  curator: Codex\n  action: CORRECTED_SOURCE_EVIDENCE_NOTE\n  changes: 'Corrected the active mapping-evidence note''s blank-result interpretation\n    to the explicitly recorded No results for the two archived BacDive di-keto rows.\n    The earlier CREATED_FROM_ORIGINAL_SOURCE_LABEL event''s blank assertion is incorrect\n    and is superseded by this event; the original event and executed source proofs\n    remain unchanged. Preserved CHEBI:11449 identity, exact mapping, source-field\n    count 2, zero recipe counts, recovered RAW_TEXT alias and absence of a production\n    role. No scientific approval is added. Inspected the archived Metabolite production\n    tables at https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/34 and https://bacdive.dsmz.de/strain/58.\n    Headers bind the exact CHEBI:11449/name row to the Production column; both cells\n    explicitly encode No in icon alt/title attributes and ph-x classes. Neighboring\n    mono-keto controls encode Yes (ph-check); their original ChEBI links are retained\n    verbatim without assigning that source link as a new MIM identity. Exact headers,\n    row HTML, icon attributes and immutable input hashes: reports/diketo_bacdive_evidence_1111_20261102/source-evidence.json\n    sha256=41defe43ca5fc06502964d155ea58376d5420c0ce2cb8ffe660294c18638d892. Finding\n    https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1111; decision https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1111#issuecomment-6588588040.'\n  previous_status: MAPPED\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: true\n  llm_model: gpt-6\n"
