    "raw_text": "identifier: kgmicrobe.compound:2-keto-d-gluconic_acid_hemicalcium_salt_monohydrate\npreferred_term: 2-Keto-D-gluconic acid hemicalcium salt monohydrate\nontology_mapping:\n  ontology_id: CHEBI:27469\n  ontology_label: 2-dehydro-D-gluconic acid\n  ontology_source: CHEBI\n  mapping_quality: CLOSE_MATCH\n  evidence:\n  - evidence_type: MANUAL_CURATION\n    source: https://www.mpbio.com/media/document/infor/S/1/1/1/0/100365-S1110.PDF\n      ; https://www.caymanchem.com/product/35622/2-keto-d-gluconic-acid-calcium-salt\n    notes: 'Refine the prior blocker: MP Biomedicals explicitly uses CAS 3470-37-9\n      for the monohydrate, while the same CAS is used for unhydrated calcium salt.\n      Use a distinct local hydrate identity and preserve the supplier CAS as procurement\n      metadata rather than exact global identity. Withdraw anhydrous CID/SMILES/InChI.\n      Formula follows the certificate hemicalcium unit plus one water, doubled to\n      whole calcium stoichiometry. Existing close match to free acid retained as reviewed\n      in #342, not promoted to subsumption.'\nsynonyms: []\nmapping_status: MAPPED\noccurrence_statistics:\n  total_occurrences: 0\n  media_count: 0\ncuration_history:\n- timestamp: '2026-04-29T06:51:33.117170+00:00'\n  curator: audit_add_remaining_culturebotht\n  action: CREATED_FROM_CAS_FALLBACK\n  changes: Created with cas:3470-37-9 as primary identifier; no CHEBI entry exists\n    for this compound.\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-01T07:35:31.738421+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_CLASSIFY_INGREDIENT_TYPE\n  changes: 'set ingredient_type=SINGLE_INGREDIENT (cas: primary (defined chemical))'\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-02T02:51:12.354832+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_BACKFILL_PUBCHEM_CHEMISTRY\n  changes: molecular_formula=C12H18CaO14; smiles=C(C(C(C(C(=O)C(=O)[O-])O)O)O)O.C(C(C(C(C(=O)C(=O)[;\n    inchi=In