 a plausible identifier promoted by a mechanism that never decided\n    anything is what #203 and #263 exist to undo. Any CURIE above is a curator''s\n    to accept or reject.'\n  llm_assisted: true\nnotes: Imported from CultureBotHT (compounds_to_cas.csv (no CAS-RN)). No CAS-RN or\n  CHEBI mapping available; curator review needed. Reviewed on 2026-05-11 as a cholinium\n  aspartate salt; not identity-mapped to component parents.\ningredient_type: SINGLE_INGREDIENT\n"
