    "raw_text": "identifier: cas:323194-76-9\npreferred_term: L-Aspartic acid sodium salt monohydrate\nontology_mapping:\n  ontology_id: CHEBI:17053\n  ontology_label: L-aspartic acid\n  ontology_source: CHEBI\n  mapping_quality: NARROW_MATCH\n  evidence:\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: CultureBotHT\n    notes: Imported from CultureBotHT. CAS-RN 323194-76-9 present, but no CHEBI entry\n      exists (checked OAK CHEBI sqlite + PubChem CID synonyms). Curator can promote\n      to a CHEBI primary if/when CHEBI adds the term.\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: CHEBI via OLS (stem-substring)\n    notes: Parent class identified via stem-substring; matched_via='L-Aspartic acid\n      sodium salt monohydrate'\n  - evidence_type: DATABASE_MATCH\n    source: MIM curation (#342)\n    notes: 'mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH, predicate skos:narrowMatch\n      -> skos:closeMatch. narrowMatch asserts this record is *narrower in meaning*\n      than CHEBI:17053 (''L-aspartic acid'') \u2014 a subsumption ChEBI itself denies:\n      it files hydrates under CHEBI:35505 ''hydrate'', never under the anhydrous compound,\n      which is not an ancestor even transitively. A hydrate is a distinct substance\n      containing the anhydrous form, not a specialization of it. closeMatch claims\n      similarity without subsumption. The ontology_id and the record''s own identifier\n      are unchanged.'\n  - evidence_type: MANUAL_CURATION\n    source: MIM Step7d scientific review (#901)\n    notes: 'Catalogueline1340 CAS323194-76-9/FW173.1 names sodium L-aspartate monohydrate;\n      PubChemCID23679051 gives one sodium, one water and Lconfiguration. No exacthydrate\n      or nearer sodium-aspartate term found in bounded CHEBI/NCIT label/synonym/CAS\n      searches. Retain CAS and broadMatch to L-asparticacidCHEBI17053 with separate\n      B1 registry. See the complete identity, mapping, chemistry and synonym assessment\n      in reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/authors/science-b/full-assessments.json;\n      owner selector data/ingredients/mapped/L-Aspartic_Acid_Sodium_Salt_Monohydrate.yaml.\n      Primary source references: https://github.com/CultureBotAI/CultureBotHT; https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/rest/pug/compound/name/323194-76-9/property/MolecularFormula,MolecularWeight,InChI,InChIKey,IUPACName/JSON;\n      https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chebi/backend/api/public/compound/17053/. Captures, exact\n      input hashes and scope limits: reports/step7d_mapping_901_20261103/evidence-manifest.json.\n      This curation adds no scientific, mapping-release or role approval; changed\n      owner bytes withdraw inherited support.'\nsynonyms:\n- synonym_text: (2S)-2-aminobutanedioic acid\n  synonym_type: REJECTED_LABEL\n  source: chebi_synonym_review\n- synonym_text: ASPARTIC ACID\n  synonym_type: REJECTED_LABEL\n  source: chebi_synonym_review\nmapping_status: MAPPED\noccurrence_statistics:\n  total_occurrences: 2\n  media_count: 2\ncuration_history:\n- timestamp: '2026-04-29T06:51:33.117170+00:00'\n  curator: audit_add_remaining_culturebotht\n  action: CREATED_FROM_CAS_FALLBACK\n  changes: Created with cas:323194-76-9 as primary identifier; no CHEBI entry exists\n    for this compound.\n  new_status: MAPPED\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-01T07:35:34.249831+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_CLASSIFY_INGREDIENT_TYPE\n  changes: 'set ingredient_type=SINGLE_INGREDIENT (cas: primary (defined chemical))'\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-02T02:53:39.527504+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_BACKFILL_PUBCHEM_CHEMISTRY\n  changes: molecular_formula=C4H8NNaO5; smiles=C(C(C(=O)[O-])N)C(=O)O.O.[Na+]; inchi=InChI=1S/C4H7NO4.Na.H2O/c5-2(4(8)9)1-3(6)7;;/h2H,1\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-02T03:12:15.369924+00:00'\n  curator: auto_classify_ingredient_type\n  action: AUTO_CLASSIFY_INGREDIENT_TYPE\n  changes: set ingredient_type=SINGLE_INGREDIENT (chemical structure populated (molecular_formula))\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-05-02T04:50:42.821029+00:00'\n  curator: backfill_parent_terms\n  action: BACKFILL_PARENT_CHEBI\n  changes: set ontology_mapping parent=CHEBI:17053 (stem-substring)\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-06-03T02:06:01.743068+00:00'\n  curator: infer_roles_from_name_lists\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Added media role: AMINO_ACID_SOURCE (confidence: 0.80)'\n- timestamp: '2026-07-20T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: migrate_media_roles_to_facets\n  action: ANNOTATED\n  changes: 'Migrated legacy media_roles to role facets (#128): AMINO_ACID_SOURCE ->\n    nutritional_roles.AMINO_ACID_SOURCE'\n- timestamp: '2026-08-13T00:00:00+00:00'\n  curator: regrade_hydrate_to_close_match\n  action: REGRADED_HYDRATE_TO_CLOSE_MATCH\n  changes: mapping_quality NARROW_MATCH -> CLOSE_MATCH (#342); a hydrate is not subsumed\n    by its anhydrous form, and ChEBI does not model it as such.\n  llm_assisted: false\n- timestamp: '2026-08-27T03:16:39.519098+00:00'\n  curator: refresh_occurrence_statistics\n  action: CORRECTED\n  changes: 'occurrence_statistics 0/0 -> 2/2 (media_count/total_occurrences), derived\n    from distinct CultureMech recipe ids in the #337 occurrence table. The prior values\n    came from the importer retired in #453, whose media_count counted a list truncated\n    to 50 examples (#449). [source=ingredient_occurrences.tsv culturemech_rev=15a4da5c08\n    rows=194137 distinct_recipes=15257]'\n- timestamp: '2026-09-22T20:41:14.285965+00:00'\n  curator: claude\n  action: REJECTED_PARENT_NAME_SYNONYMS\n  changes: 'Retyped names of the parent compound or of a different hydrate as provenance-only\n    REJECTED_LABEL, because this record is a distinct salt, hydrate or tombstone form\n    and the label index resolved the parent''s name here (#232): ''(2S)-2-aminobutanedioic\n    acid''; ''ASPARTIC ACID''. Preserved original text and source metadata. No identity,\n    mapping,